 "text": "Hi, how have you been? It' probably your internet connection. Do you use a mobile network or cable? You can make the chair look big by shooting towards the window. Put the chair in front of the window and place your subject few meters from it, so the window fills the background. Try having them sit near a wall and have them talk close to the mic. A pair of earphones and a microphone can help too. Shoot from higher up if you can, or on the same level as your subject, so their face fits in the frame.",
